<div class="our-story-page"><section class="our-story-hero container"><div><span class="eyebrow">Our Story · Since 2019</span><h1>Some flavours<br>feel like <em>home.</em></h1><p>Every jar, every pack, every batter carries the warmth of a home kitchen. That is where our story begins.</p><a class="text-link" href="#people-behind-the-kitchen">Meet the people behind it</a></div><div class="story-granny-frame art-wash"><img src="{{ 'ammammas-granny.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="Ammamma, the heart of our kitchen"><span>“Come, have a little more.”</span></div></section><section class="story-origin container"><span class="eyebrow">From Ammamma’s kitchen to yours</span><div class="story-origin-grid"><h2>A small kitchen.<br>A lot of love.</h2><div><p>We started Ammamma’s in 2019 with a simple mission: to bring the authentic taste of traditional Indian kitchens to modern homes, without compromises.</p><p>What began as a small kitchen experiment has grown into a brand bringing the taste of grandmother’s cooking to homes across India. Pickles, spice powders, chapatis, parotas and more: familiar food for the way we live today.</p></div></div></section><div class="story-village"><img src="{{ 'village-street.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="An illustrated South Indian neighbourhood with tiled homes and a banyan tree"></div><section class="story-rituals"><div class="container"><div class="center-heading"><span class="eyebrow">The feeling we carry forward</span><h2>More than a recipe.</h2></div><div class="story-ritual-grid"><article><span class="art-wash"><img src="{{ 'love.svg' | asset_url }}" alt=""></span><h3>The extra serving.</h3><p>Love has a way of asking, “A little more?”</p></article><article><span class="art-wash"><img src="{{ 'tiffin.svg' | asset_url }}" alt=""></span><h3>The box for home.</h3><p>Because nobody leaves Ammamma’s empty-handed.</p></article><article><span class="art-wash"><img src="{{ 'mortar.svg' | asset_url }}" alt=""></span><h3>The familiar flavour.</h3><p>A little reminder of the kitchen you grew up around.</p></article></div></div></section><div id="people-behind-the-kitchen" class="container story-team"><section class="story-team-group"><div class="story-team-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Our people</span><h2>Founders & Core Team</h2><p>The people who started it all.</p></div><div class="story-people-grid"><article class="story-person" data-reveal><div class="story-person-photo"><img src="{{ 'ref-4e64783ee9d6.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Prathima Viswanath" loading="lazy"></div><div class="story-person-copy"><h3>Prathima Viswanath</h3><p class="story-role">Founder / Director</p><p class="story-bio">Driven by a passion for authentic food, a mother of two wonderful daughters. Enjoys meditation and yoga. Faculty at Art of Living foundation</p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/prathima-viswanath" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article><article class="story-person" data-reveal><div class="story-person-photo"><img src="{{ 'ref-940bf1b68bdf.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Nagasai Viswanath" loading="lazy"></div><div class="story-person-copy"><h3>Nagasai Viswanath</h3><p class="story-role">Founder &amp; CEO</p><p class="story-bio">25+ years of experience in FMCG, Beverage and Telecommunication industry. Worked in India, UK, Nigeria and Ghana.</p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/nagasai2naga.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article><article class="story-person" data-reveal><div class="story-person-photo"><img src="{{ 'ref-d9b5d49e121b.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Sri Lakshmi Challa" loading="lazy"></div><div class="story-person-copy"><h3>Sri Lakshmi Challa</h3><p class="story-role">Head of Production</p><p class="story-bio">Founding member, lady with a strong will and determination. Her energy drives the manufacturing team to meet the production demands from time to time</p></div></article><article class="story-person" data-reveal><div class="story-person-photo"><img src="{{ 'ref-66b70b2896a5.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Padma Lata Karra" loading="lazy"></div><div class="story-person-copy"><h3>Padma Lata Karra</h3><p class="story-role">Business growth and Operations. CGO</p><p class="story-bio">Founding Member, Lata is the backbone of the growth shaping brand ammamma&#x27;s from a local, regional brand to national foot print. Today she made the brand available in 12 states and 40 cities</p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/padma-latha-karra-260488341" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article></div></section><section class="story-team-group"><div class="story-team-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Our people</span><h2>The Next Generation</h2><p>Taking the story forward.</p></div><div class="story-people-grid"><article class="story-person" data-reveal><div class="story-person-photo"><img src="{{ 'ref-3f02b475474b.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Tejaswi Oruganti" loading="lazy"></div><div class="story-person-copy"><h3>Tejaswi Oruganti</h3><p class="story-role">Retail Business Co-Ordinator</p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/tejaswi-oruganti-0b2547229" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article><article class="story-person" data-reveal><div class="story-person-photo"><img src="{{ 'ref-b3ae93bbf901.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Sahithi Kota" loading="lazy"></div><div class="story-person-copy"><h3>Sahithi Kota</h3><p class="story-role">Q-Com Business Co-ordinator</p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kota-sahithi-4704a5216" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article><article class="story-person" data-reveal><div class="story-person-photo"><img src="{{ 'ref-adb0b561d321.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Shravani Gunji" loading="lazy"></div><div class="story-person-copy"><h3>Shravani Gunji</h3><p class="story-role">Production Co-ordinator</p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/shravani-gunji-182683366" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article><article class="story-person" data-reveal><div class="story-person-photo"><img src="{{ 'ref-09f1d26495e6.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Koti Reddy M" loading="lazy"></div><div class="story-person-copy"><h3>Koti Reddy M</h3><p class="story-role">Coordinator Karnataka</p><p class="story-bio">Karnataka</p></div></article><article class="story-person" data-reveal><div class="story-person-photo"><img src="{{ 'ref-bb69dc59136e.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Manoj" loading="lazy"></div><div class="story-person-copy"><h3>Manoj</h3><p class="story-role">Intercity Logistics Coordinator</p></div></article></div></section><section class="story-team-group"><div class="story-team-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Our people</span><h2>Industry Experts</h2><p>Experience at the table.</p></div><div class="story-people-grid"><article class="story-person" data-reveal><div class="story-person-photo"><img src="{{ 'ref-f0bdfa9e46c4.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Jaggruthi K" loading="lazy"></div><div class="story-person-copy"><h3>Jaggruthi K</h3><p class="story-role">Production Consultant</p><p class="story-bio">Passionate about food. Owner of a ready to cook food brand Bhima&#x27;s</p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jaggruthi-d-8284a4107" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article></div></section><section class="story-team-group"><div class="story-team-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Our people</span><h2>Mentors & Advisors</h2><p>A little guidance goes a long way.</p></div><div class="story-people-grid"><article class="story-person" data-reveal><div class="story-person-photo"><img src="{{ 'ref-9cdcab7f3220.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Vijay Kumar Thundi" loading="lazy"></div><div class="story-person-copy"><h3>Vijay Kumar Thundi</h3><p class="story-role">Mentor</p><p class="story-bio">FMCG veteran, Ex-CGO Paradise group</p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/vijaykumar-thundi-b868962" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article></div></section></div><div class="container story-numbers"><div><strong>10 lac+</strong><span>Happy Customers</span></div><div><strong>50+</strong><span>Products</span></div><div><strong>40+</strong><span>Cities Served</span></div><div><strong>4.8&#9733;</strong><span>Average Rating</span></div></div><section class="story-invitation"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">There is always room at our table</span><h2>A little home,<br>wherever you are.</h2><a class="button" href="/collections/all">Come into our kitchen</a></div></section></div>
